@Laqeeta_HostAddress = http://localhost:5270

### register
POST {{Laqeeta_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test User", "username": "test", "email": "test@example.com", "phone": "01000000099", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### login
POST {{Laqeeta_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "omar", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### me (paste the token)
GET {{Laqeeta_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>
